    "title": "Hazmat Called After Truck Leak Shuts I-40 East - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Bobbie Lewis ,\n6 hours ago A tractor-trailer crash on I-40 East near Prosser Road early Tuesday turned the morning drive into a headache for commuters, after the rig began leaking diesel and at least one eastbound lane was shut. Knoxville police and fire crews responded to the wreck, requested a HAZMAT team, and urged drivers to steer clear while the roadway was secured. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
